去，越压越难受。你最近一次特别想反驳却硬生生忍住，是什么时候？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2310,"promptTokens":159,"completionTokens":180,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:50:28"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"f91b5de0864949e9b05daf76d515262d","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010984435517070006,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb57459efdd2548215247","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143028996,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:50:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb57459efdd2548215247","chatId":"552eea40dfa348e6b22489f972fe7352","sessionId":null,"userId":129575,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最早……好像是我妈吧，她总说少说两句就没事了。可我心里不服气，又不敢顶嘴。现在想想，我好像一直都在学“闭嘴”，可越憋越难受。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"f91b5de0864949e9b05daf76d515262d","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010984435517070006,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6affb57459efdd2548215248","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143028993,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:50:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb56d59efdd2548215227","chatId":"552eea40dfa348e6b22489f972fe7352","sessionId":null,"userId":129575,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听起来那句“又来了”一冒出来，你就马上想到爸爸发火，身体也跟着发紧；在家里连做决定都要先过爸妈那关，真的很累。此刻你最想先弄清楚的是，这句“学不会闭嘴”最早是从谁那里听来的吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听起来那句“又来了”一冒出来，你就马上想到爸爸发火，身体也跟着发紧；在家里连做决定都要先过爸妈那关，真的很累。此刻你最想先弄清楚的是，这句“学不会闭嘴”最早是从谁那里听来的吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3786,"promptTokens":160,"completionTokens":414,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:50:21"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"31cc409143714da29bbc96c1fbc6ac51","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006691051266825986,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb56d59efdd2548215226","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143021070,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:50:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb56d59efdd2548215226","chatId":"552eea40dfa348e6b22489f972fe7352","sessionId":null,"userId":129575,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最先冒出来的……就是“又来了，我怎么就学不会闭嘴”。然后会想起我爸以前发火的样子，心里发紧。在我家，做什么决定都得先想我爸妈会怎么说，特别累。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"resp